# Vendored browser libraries, copied verbatim into app/lib/ by save_html().
#
# They are third-party build output, not source: Git must not rewrite their line
# endings. With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) it otherwise checks them
# out as CRLF while every build copies them back as LF, so `git status` reports
# 2 MB of unchanged JavaScript as modified after each local build -- and a
# `git add app/lib` would commit the flipped copies.
app/lib/** -text
